<title>FINLAND: FEC to finance Thai pulp and paper plant expansion.</title>
<headline>FEC to finance Thai pulp and paper plant expansion.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish Export Credit (FEC) said in a statement on Monday it would finance Advance Agro Public's pulp and paper plant expansion in Thailand.</p>
<p>&quot;The amount of the credit is $160 million or 730 million markka,&quot; the FEC said.</p>
<p>&quot;The total value of the project is over one billion markka,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>Deliveries to the plant construction would come from Kvaerner Pulping Ab, A.Ahlstrom Oy, ABB and Rauma's Sunds Defibrator, the FEC said. -- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
